msgstr "Afficher sur le radar longue portée"

#: src/screens/gm/tweak.cpp:4677
msgctxt "tweak-tab"
msgid "Raw radar signature"
msgstr "Signature radar brute"

#: src/screens/gm/tweak.cpp:4678
msgctxt "tweak-raw-radar-signature"
msgid ""
"Permanent radar signature values (gravitational, electrical, thermal) that "
"modify the sensor bands on the Target Analysis creen and Science and "
"Operations radars."
msgstr ""
"Valeurs de signature radar permanentes (gravitationnelle, électrique, "
"thermique) qui modifient les bandes de capteurs sur l'écran d'Analyse de "
"cible et les radars Science et Opérations."

#: src/screens/gm/tweak.cpp:4679 src/screens/gm/tweak.cpp:4686
msgctxt "tweak-text"
msgid "Gravitational:"
msgstr "Gravitationnel :"

#: src/screens/gm/tweak.cpp:4680 src/screens/gm/tweak.cpp:4687
msgctxt "tweak-text"
msgid "Electrical:"
msgstr "Électrique :"

#: src/screens/gm/tweak.cpp:4681 src/screens/gm/tweak.cpp:4688
msgctxt "tweak-text"
msgid "Thermal:"
msgstr "Thermique :"

#: src/screens/gm/tweak.cpp:4684
msgctxt "tweak-tab"
msgid "Dynamic radar signature"
msgstr "Signature radar dynamique"

#: src/screens/gm/tweak.cpp:4685
msgctxt "tweak-dynamic-radar-signature"
msgid ""
"Live radar signature values updated by the game engine during play, "
"reflecting current ship state. For modifiable base values, see the Raw radar "
"signature component."
msgstr ""
"Valeurs de signature radar en direct mises à jour par le moteur du jeu "
"pendant la partie, reflétant l'état actuel du vaisseau. Pour les valeurs de "
"base modifiables, voir le composant Signature radar brute."

#: src/screens/gm/tweak.cpp:4691
msgctxt "tweak-tab"
msgid "Missile flight"
msgstr "Vol de missile"

#: src/screens/gm/tweak.cpp:4692
msgctxt "tweak-missile-flight"
msgid ""
"Parameters relevant if this entity is a missile in flight. Defines maximum "
"travel speed and flight timeout before self-destruction."
msgstr ""
"Paramètres pertinents si cette entité est un missile en vol. Définit la "
"vitesse de déplacement maximale et le délai de vol avant autodestruction."

#: src/screens/gm/tweak.cpp:4694
msgctxt "tweak-text"
msgid "Timeout:"
msgstr "Temporisation :"

#: src/screens/gm/tweak.cpp:4697
msgctxt "tweak-tab"
msgid "Missile homing"
msgstr "Guidage de missile"

#: src/screens/gm/tweak.cpp:4698
msgctxt "tweak-missile-homing"
msgid ""
"Defines this entity's homing guidance system, turn rate for tracking, "
"acquisition range, and the current tracked target entity. Most relevant if "
"this entity is a missile."
msgstr ""
"Définit le système de guidage de cette entité, le taux de virage pour le "
"suivi, la portée d'acquisition et l'entité cible actuellement suivie. Plus "
"pertinent si cette entité est un missile."

#: src/screens/gm/tweak.cpp:4699
msgctxt "tweak-text"
msgid "Turn rate:"
msgstr "Taux de virage :"

#: src/screens/gm/tweak.cpp:4704
msgctxt "tweak-tab"
msgid "Explode on touch"
msgstr "Explosion au contact"

#: src/screens/gm/tweak.cpp:4705
msgctxt "tweak-explode-on-touch"
msgid ""
"Explodes upon collision with another entity. Defines center/edge damage "
"falloff, blast radius, owner, damage type, and explosion sound."
msgstr ""
"Explose lors d'une collision avec une autre entité. Définit l'atténuation "
"des dégâts centre/bordure, le rayon d'explosion, le propriétaire, le type de "
"dégâts et le son d'explosion."

#: src/screens/gm/tweak.cpp:4706 src/screens/gm/tweak.cpp:4721
msgctxt "tweak-text"
msgid "Damage at center:"
msgstr "Dégâts au centre :"

#: src/screens/gm/tweak.cpp:4707 src/screens/gm/tweak.cpp:4722
msgctxt "tweak-text"
msgid "Damage at edge:"
msgstr "Dégâts en bordure :"

#: src/screens/gm/tweak.cpp:4708 src/screens/gm/tweak.cpp:4723
msgctxt "tweak-text"
msgid "Blast range:"
msgstr "Portée d'explosion :"

#: src/screens/gm/tweak.cpp:4712 src/screens/gm/tweak.cpp:4727
msgctxt "tweak-text"
msgid "Explosion SFX:"
msgstr "SFX d'explosion :"

#: src/screens/gm/tweak.cpp:4715
msgctxt "tweak-tab"
msgid "Explode on timeout"
msgstr "Explosion temporisée"

#: src/screens/gm/tweak.cpp:4716
msgctxt "tweak-explode-on-timeout"
msgid ""
"Marker component for missiles or other weapons that detonate when their "
"Missile flight component flight timer expires."
msgstr ""
"Composant marqueur pour les missiles ou autres armes qui explosent lorsque "
"leur minuteur de vol du composant Vol de missile expire."

#: src/screens/gm/tweak.cpp:4719
msgctxt "tweak-tab"
msgid "Delayed explode on touch"
msgstr "Explosion différée au contact"

#: src/screens/gm/tweak.cpp:4720
msgctxt "tweak-delayed-explode-on-touch"
msgid ""
"Contact detonation with an arming period. Doesn't trigger until the trigger "
"holdoff delay expires after first contact."
msgstr ""
"Détonation de contact avec une période d'armement. Ne se déclenche pas "
"jusqu'à ce que le délai de temporisation expire après le premier contact."

