msgid "Interaction type:"
msgstr "Type d'interaction :"

#: src/gui/hotkeyBinder.cpp:400
msgctxt "hotkey_menu"
msgid ""
"Discrete: Acts only once when pressed. (Buttons, encoders, switches)\n"
"\n"
"Continuous: Acts every frame for as long as it's held down. (Steering using "
"buttons, smooth sliders)\n"
"\n"
"Repeating: Acts once, waits, then acts repeatedly. (Keyboard repeating, "
"sliders with stepped values)\n"
"\n"
"Axis one-way: Control rests at a minimum value and is fully engaged at its "
"maximum. (Triggers, throttles)\n"
"\n"
"Axis two-way: Control is centered at rest and can be pushed in two "
"directions from there. (Joysticks)"
msgstr ""
"Discret : Agit une seule fois lorsqu'on appuie. (Boutons, encodeurs, "
"interrupteurs)\n"
"\n"
"Continu : Agit à chaque image tant qu'on maintient enfoncé. (Direction avec "
"boutons, curseurs lisses)\n"
"\n"
"Répétitif : Agit une fois, attend, puis agit à plusieurs reprises. "
"(Répétition clavier, curseurs à valeurs progressives)\n"
"\n"
"Axe unidirectionnel : La commande est au repos à une valeur minimale et est "
"complètement engagée à son maximum. (Gâchettes, manettes)\n"
"\n"
"Axe bidirectionnel : La commande est centrée au repos et peut être poussée "
"dans deux directions. (Joysticks)"

